      problem: ['The brief was sustainable packaging for an everyday dry good. Other people picked rice, other foods or toilet paper. I picked menstrual products, because of how much waste the category creates. The average menstruating person uses 11,000 to 16,000 disposable pads in their lifetime.', 'I also wanted it to feel elevated. Most packaging in this space is either a standard cardboard box or an organic-looking carton, and I wanted Lune to be sustainable without being visually apologetic.'],
